WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Estimated savings, with owner review time included. All history shown is synthetic demo data.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Start a task with a reusable component. The escalation example demonstrates a failed output check.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The proposed action stops in staging and waits for the owner's decision.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
The owner edits and approves. Trial mode records the result without performing the operation.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
EfficientAI shows both model attempts and their estimated token costs.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Six versioned components form a shared library. Sector packs add industry rules.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Choose a sector, switch on components and fill in the business setup.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
A second business reuses the same components. Saved reuse counts increase to two.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Compare estimated staff time with review time and AI cost. Export the trial report as a PDF.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Gluons: a little AI, a lot more time. Explore the working demo or request a free trial.
